<title>CHILE: TENNIS-CHILE AND ARGENTINA LEVEL 1-1 IN DAVIS CUP.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-CHILE AND ARGENTINA LEVEL 1-1 IN DAVIS CUP.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chile and Argentina were leve 1-1</p>
<p>after the opening singles in their Davis Cup American zone group</p>
<p>one second round match on Friday.</p>
<p>Results (Chilean names first):</p>
<p>Marcelo Rios beat Javier Frana 6-1 6-4 7-6 (7-2)</p>
<p>Gabriel Silberstein lost to Hernan Gumy 0-6 4-6 4-6</p>
</text>
